  "mapDesc.iron_gate": "A garrison and an old town: the freight yard, the old-town square, the fuel depot, the factory district and the iron gate checkpoint. The five-floor hospital on the rise is the landmark.",
  "mapDesc.ardennes": "Snowy forest and a knee-deep river: a big winter battlefield fought over a stone bridge, the mill footbridge, the rail bridge and the village hotel.",
  "mapDesc.lyon": "A meadow front across a creek: the farm in the middle, the barn and silo west, the orchard east. Three bridges are the way across.",
  "mapDesc.bilbao": "A riverside city under siege: hold the attack from the east at the warehouse yard, the tank square and the cathedral. Made for Conquest.",
  "mapDesc.persia": "A desert village square, an oasis bridge and a fort. For small fights (1v1 to 2v2), light vehicles only.",
  "mapDesc.sandbox": "A practice range with every weapon and targets.",
  "modeDesc.zone": "Every zone you hold scores a point every 5 s. First side to the target wins.",
  "modeDesc.frontline": "A front pushed one sector at a time. Losing a sector makes you the attacker; run out of attack time and the roles swap.",
  "modeDesc.conquest": "The defenders start with every zone; the attackers break through one sector at a time. Only the attackers have tickets.",
  "modeDesc.skirmish": "Just the fight, no zones.",
